== untagged without an image is unknown
file: .gitlab-ci.yml
message: the verify command `task verify` runs on no Linux runner (called in .gitlab-ci.yml job a, .gitlab-ci.yml job b); runners of unknown platform: job a: no tags and no image
fix: run `task verify` on Linux too: in a job whose tags name a runner of that platform, such as tags: [windows] (saas-windows-medium-amd64 on GitLab.com), or with a parallel: matrix over the tags

